---
import Base from "../layouts/Base.astro";
Astro.response.headers.set("Cache-Control", "public, max-age=3600, s-maxage=86400");
const updated = "26 November 2026";
---
<Base title="Privacy policy" description="How SupQuotes handles your data, cookies and ads.">
  <article class="prose">
    <h1>Privacy policy</h1>
    <p class="lede">Last updated {updated}</p>

    <h2>The short version</h2>
    <ul>
      <li>You don't need an account, and we don't ask for your name, email or phone number.</li>
      <li>Cards are made <strong>in your browser</strong>. The text you type (including names in wishes) and the images you create are not uploaded to or stored on our servers.</li>
      <li>We show ads from <strong>Google AdSense</strong>, which uses cookies. More on that below.</li>
    </ul>

    <h2>What we don't collect</h2>
    <p>
      SupQuotes has no sign-up, no database of users and no contact forms. When you type a name into a wish, it stays on
      your device unless you choose to share the card or a link yourself. A shared link like
      <code>/wish/…?name=Priya</code> contains that name in the address, so only share links with people you're happy to show it to.
    </p>

    <h2>Advertising (Google AdSense)</h2>
    <p>
      We use Google AdSense to show ads. Google and its partners use cookies to show ads based on your visits to this
      and other websites. Google's use of advertising cookies lets it and its partners serve ads based on your visits to
      SupQuotes and/or other sites on the Internet.
    </p>
    <ul>
      <li>You can turn off personalised ads in <a href="https://adssettings.google.com" rel="noopener">Google Ads Settings</a>.</li>
      <li>You can opt out of some third-party vendors' use of cookies for personalised ads at <a href="https://www.aboutads.info/choices/" rel="noopener">aboutads.info</a>.</li>
      <li>How Google uses data from sites that use its services: <a href="https://policies.google.com/technologies/partner-sites" rel="noopener">policies.google.com/technologies/partner-sites</a>.</li>
    </ul>
    <p>Visitors in the EEA, the UK and Switzerland are asked for consent before personalised ads are shown.</p>

    <h2>Other services</h2>
    <ul>
      <li><strong>Cloudflare</strong> hosts the site and may log basic request data (such as IP address and browser type) for security and performance.</li>
      <li><strong>Google Fonts</strong> serves the fonts used on the site and on cards.</li>
    </ul>

    <h2>Children</h2>
    <p>SupQuotes is a general-audience site and does not knowingly collect personal information from children.</p>

    <h2>Changes</h2>
    <p>If this policy changes, we'll update the date at the top of this page.</p>
  </article>
</Base>

<style>
  .prose { max-width: 720px; }
  .prose h2 { margin-top: 28px; font-size: 20px; }
  .prose p, .prose li { color: var(--text); }
  .prose a { color: var(--brand); }
  .prose code { font-size: 13px; background: var(--surface-2); padding: 1px 5px; border-radius: 4px; }
</style>
